    "detailed_description": "Do you smell this? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt smells like manhood and courage! Welcome to the national army in this simulation realistic game! Everyone relies on you because your mission will be a difficult one, namely you must to be responsible for everything related to transportation, starting with soldiers and ending with army equipment. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNothing will happen without your participation. There is no pressure on you, but a lot of responsibility is required to get from point A to point B safely. Rule number 1 - no one should know about rule number 2,3,4.. That's why we took you, because the army needs trained and absolutely secretive people. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready ? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features : <br />\r\n- 3 Game Modes ( Soldier Transport,Cargo Transport and Vehicle Transport)<br />\r\n- Each mode has 10 levels<br />\r\n- Truck Damage &amp; Map",
